<body>
<div class="card">

<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">HZ-07 · ¥39</div>
  <h1>HZ-007 奶香芝士炸鸡 / 脆皮芝士雪花炸鸡</h1>
  <div class="sub">韩式炸鸡 · 摆摊 ✅ 夜市 ✅ 炸鸡店 ✅</div>
  <div class="tags">
    <span>芝士控福音</span>
    <span>奶香浓郁</span>
    <span>视觉冲击</span>
    <span>网红属性</span>
    <span>女生最爱</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">推荐 ★★★★★</span>
  <span class="level-item med">网红爆款</span>
  <span class="level-item med">颜值高</span>
  <span class="level-item med">利润可观</span>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">发现这款产品</div>
  <div class="story">
    今年五一节在广州大学城贝岗夜市，有家新开的韩式炸鸡摊围了里三层外三层。挤进去一看，老板正在做芝士雪花炸鸡——炸好的鸡块上淋一层奶香芝士酱，再撒一层芝士粉和帕玛森干酪碎，白花花的像下雪一样。<br><br>
    排队的大多是女生，人手一份芝士炸鸡配年糕。老板说这个配方他试了两个月才定下来——芝士酱用奶油奶酪加牛奶和炼乳调，薄薄裹一层，不能太厚，不然吃着腻。然后趁热撒上一层冻干的芝士粉，跟雪一样飘上去，看着就食欲大增。<em>一天卖了210份</em>，芝士味占了一半多。<br><br>
    另外一个变体是脆皮芝士雪花——炸的时候裹浆里加芝士粉，炸出来自带芝士味，出锅再撒一层雪花芝士粉。两种做法成本差不多，但口感不一样，可以给客人多一个选择。
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目指数</div>
  <div class="index-grid">
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">轻资产</div><div class="num">★★★★☆</div><div class="desc">投入约1000元</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">难度</div><div class="num">★★★☆☆</div><div class="desc">3天可上手</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">利润</div><div class="num">★★★★☆</div><div class="desc">53%毛利率</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">复购</div><div class="num">★★★★☆</div><div class="desc">芝士控复购极高</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">成本利润</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>卖价</span><span class="v">15元/份（约200g）</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>成本（原料）</span><span class="v">7元/份</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>单份利润</span><span class="v" style="color:#C0392B">8元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销40份日利润</span><span class="v">320元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销60份日利润</span><span class="v">480元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>月固定开销</span><span class="v">约1500元</span></div>
    <div class="row tot"><span>设备投入</span><span class="v">约800-1200元</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-top:6px">回本周期</div>
  <div class="roi">
    <div class="roi-b c"><div>保守</div><div class="d">5天</div><div>日销40份</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b n"><div>正常</div><div class="d">3天</div><div>日销60份</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b i"><div>理想</div><div class="d">2天</div><div>日销80份</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目风险</div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>芝士酱易腻</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">芝士量控制不好腻死人</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>芝士粉受潮</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">粉结块了撒上去不好看</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>原料成本</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">奶油奶酪不便宜</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>视觉落差</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">拍出来好看实际吃着有落差</span>
  </div>
</div>

