    <span><strong>总投入：</strong>约900元</span>
    <span><strong>占地：</strong>1.5m摊位</span>
    <span><strong>人员：</strong>1-2人</span>
    <span><strong>上手：</strong>3天</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
